# Copy to ~/.config/mac-secure/adopt-apps.txt, then run: mac-secure enable adopt-apps
#
# Format: Homebrew cask token|app bundle name in /Applications
#
# An app that updates itself only does so while it runs, so one left closed falls behind. A listed
# app is reinstalled under Homebrew once, which then updates it while closed. An app you have deleted
# is not reinstalled. A cask whose installer is a pkg needs vendor-installers instead.
firefox|Firefox.app
slack|Slack.app
